{"id": "s-0251", "domain": "veterinary clinic", "names": ["Reception", "Exam", "Kennel"], "text": "At the clinic, animals walk from Reception to Exam and then to the Kennel. Hook those up as a chain, please. I'd like the Kennel to be a big brown rectangle, and I want to hear whether the Exam room touches the Kennel.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Reception,Exam,Kennel", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Kennel", "shape": "rectangle", "size": "large", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Exam", "anchor": "Kennel"}}]}
{"id": "s-0252", "domain": "returns process", "names": ["Request", "Inspect", "Refund"], "text": "Customers file a Request, we Inspect the item, and then the Refund goes out. Chain all three. Colour Refund green. If Inspect fails there's a loop back, so connect Inspect to Request too. Is that a cycle now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Request,Inspect,Refund", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Refund", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Inspect", "to": "Request"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0253", "domain": "tennis tournament", "names": ["Seed1", "Seed2", "Final"], "text": "Seed1 and Seed2 both reach the Final, so link them. Seed1 should sit above Seed2. The Final is huge and gold, no discussion. Also, am I right that the Final is the biggest?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Seed1,Seed2", "to": "Final"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Seed1", "position": "above", "anchor": "Seed2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Final", "size": "huge", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0254", "domain": "space colony", "names": ["Dome", "Farm", "Reactor"], "text": "Slide the Reactor to the far right, away from the Dome. The Farm should be green and sit underneath the Dome. Then wire the Reactor to the Dome with a red arrow, it's the power cable. Lastly, how far is the Farm from the Reactor, I mean is it the farthest from it?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Reactor", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Farm", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Farm", "position": "below", "anchor": "Dome"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Reactor", "to": "Dome", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Reactor", "superlative": "farthest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0255", "domain": "church", "names": ["Pastor", "Choir", "Deacon"], "text": "For our church chart: the Pastor is the top. The Choir and the Deacon report to him. Please do the arrows and set the Pastor to purple and large. Is the Pastor connected to the Choir?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Pastor", "to": "Choir,Deacon"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pastor", "color": "purple", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Pastor", "anchor": "Choir"}}]}
{"id": "s-0256", "domain": "car wash", "names": ["Soap", "Rinse", "Dry"], "text": "Soap, Rinse, Dry: cars roll through in that order. Draw it as a row with arrows between. Dry is the final step so give it a white colour. Oh yeah, and delete the Rinse, the car wash is going touchless.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Soap,Rinse,Dry", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Soap,Rinse,Dry", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dry", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "Rinse"}}]}
{"id": "s-0257", "domain": "dna replication", "names": ["Helix", "Primer", "Strand"], "text": "Helix unwinds, a Primer attaches, a Strand grows. Draw the arrows one by one, Helix to Primer to Strand. The Strand needs to be long, so use a huge rectangle. Hmm, are there cycles? There shouldn't be any.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Helix,Primer,Strand", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Strand", "shape": "rectangle", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0258", "domain": "power grid", "names": ["Plant", "Substation", "Home"], "text": "Power goes from the Plant to the Substation and on to the Home. Use thick... uh, solid arrows. The Substation is a hexagon, and orange. Put the Home at the bottom. Which one has the most connections?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Plant,Substation,Home", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Substation", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Home", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0259", "domain": "rock paper scissors", "names": ["Rock", "Paper", "Scissors"], "text": "Rock beats Scissors, Scissors beats Paper, and Paper beats Rock. Draw the three arrows so it forms a ring. Arrange them in a circle too. Is this a cycle? I'm pretty sure it is.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Rock,Scissors,Paper,Rock", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Rock,Paper,Scissors", "layout": "circle"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0260", "domain": "coffee shop", "names": ["Grinder", "Espresso", "Milk"], "text": "Milk goes near the Espresso machine; scoot it over. The Grinder is brown, the Espresso is black and the Milk is white. Group them into a row, and tell me if the Milk is left of the Espresso.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Milk", "position": "near", "anchor": "Espresso"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Grinder", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Espresso", "color": "black"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Milk", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Grinder,Espresso,Milk", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Milk", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Espresso"}}]}
{"id": "s-0261", "domain": "admissions", "names": ["Apply", "Essay", "Decision"], "text": "A student sends an Apply form, writes the Essay, and waits for the Decision. Wire them in order, using dotted arrows. I want a gold star near the Decision for the acceptance. Is the star the nearest shape to the Decision?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Apply,Essay,Decision", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "star", "color": "gold", "position": "near", "anchor": "Decision"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Decision", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0262", "domain": "forest fire", "names": ["Spark", "Tree1", "Tree2"], "text": "A spark lights Tree1, then Tree1 lights Tree2: arrows, please. Colour the Spark red, and both trees orange since they're burning. Which shapes are orange? Then undo the last colour change, the trees were fine.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Spark,Tree1,Tree2", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Spark", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Tree1,Tree2", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}]}
{"id": "s-0263", "domain": "recycling", "names": ["Bin", "Sorter", "Plant"], "text": "The Bin empties into the Sorter, which then feeds the Plant. Do it with two arrows, I'm tired. And add 3 tiny green squares near the Bin, those are the bottles. Count the squares afterwards.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Bin,Sorter,Plant", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "size": "tiny", "color": "green", "count": "3", "position": "near", "anchor": "Bin"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "square"}}]}
{"id": "s-0264", "domain": "playlist", "names": ["Intro", "Verse", "Chorus"], "text": "Intro first, Verse second, Chorus third, left to right, spaced out evenly. Make the Chorus magenta and the loudest, I mean the largest. Does the Intro come before the Verse horizontally, meaning is it left of it?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Intro,Verse,Chorus", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Intro,Verse,Chorus", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Chorus", "color": "magenta", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Intro", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Verse"}}]}
{"id": "s-0265", "domain": "chess", "names": ["Rook", "Bishop", "Knight"], "text": "I'm teaching chess with shapes. Rook is a square, Bishop is a triangle, Knight is a diamond. Please fix those. The Knight needs to be indigo. And make a list of the diamonds, would you?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rook", "shape": "square"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bishop", "shape": "triangle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Knight", "shape": "diamond"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Knight", "color": "indigo"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "shape": "diamond"}}]}
{"id": "s-0266", "domain": "call routing", "names": ["Menu", "Sales", "Billing"], "text": "Menu branches into Sales and Billing. Add them with arrows, and put Sales above Billing. Make the Menu a diamond. And it would be great if you could label it \"press 1\"... wait, call it \"press 1 or 2\".", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Menu", "to": "Sales,Billing"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Sales", "position": "above", "anchor": "Billing"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Menu", "shape": "diamond"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Menu", "label": "press 1 or 2"}}]}
{"id": "s-0267", "domain": "wild west", "names": ["Saloon", "Bank", "Jail"], "text": "Put the Jail next to the Saloon, it saves time. Make the Bank bigger and gold. Delete the newest circle, the sheriff doesn't need it. How many shapes are in the town now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Jail", "position": "near", "anchor": "Saloon"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Bank"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bank", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "mention(recency=newest,shape=circle)"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
{"id": "s-0268", "domain": "mobile network", "names": ["Phone", "Tower", "Core"], "text": "Phone talks to Tower, Tower talks to Core, both ways. Use two-way arrows. The Phone is a tiny circle. Hmm, and I want the Core at the top of the screen, so move it there. Neighbors of the Tower, please.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Phone,Tower,Core", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Phone", "shape": "circle", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Core", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Tower"}}]}
{"id": "s-0269", "domain": "school", "names": ["Principal", "Teacher", "Student"], "text": "Principal over Teacher over Student, vertical stack. Put it in a column. The principal is red, the teacher is yellow and the student is green, like a traffic light. And what colour is the Teacher?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Principal,Teacher,Student", "layout": "column"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Principal", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Teacher", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Student", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Teacher", "property": "color"}}]}
{"id": "s-0270", "domain": "warehouse robots", "names": ["Bot1", "Bot2", "Charger"], "text": "Both Bots go to the Charger, so an arrow from each. Make Bot1 yellow and Bot2 cyan, to tell them apart. Then swap the two Bots, the layout flipped. Is the Charger the most connected shape?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Bot1,Bot2", "to": "Charger"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bot1", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bot2", "color": "cyan"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "swap", "target": "Bot1,Bot2"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0271", "domain": "movie plot", "names": ["Hero", "Mentor", "Villain"], "text": "The Mentor guides the Hero, the Hero fights the Villain, that's the plot. Link those with arrows. The Villain will be big and black, obviously. Then say what the Hero is connected to.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Mentor,Hero,Villain", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Villain", "size": "large", "color": "black"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Hero"}}]}
{"id": "s-0272", "domain": "packaging", "names": ["Box", "Tape", "Label"], "text": "Make the tape lime, not gray; it's easier to see. Label the Box \"fragile\". Place the Label above the Box and give me the shape of Label.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Tape", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Box", "label": "fragile"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Label", "position": "above", "anchor": "Box"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Label", "property": "shape"}}]}
{"id": "s-0273", "domain": "cloud billing", "names": ["Usage", "Rate", "Invoice"], "text": "So, uh, Usage times Rate gives Invoice. Both Usage and Rate should point at Invoice. The Invoice is a gold hexagon, you know? Also, make Rate smaller. Does the Usage reach the Invoice?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Usage,Rate", "to": "Invoice"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Invoice", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Rate"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Usage", "to": "Invoice"}}]}
{"id": "s-0274", "domain": "floor plan", "names": ["Living", "Dining", "Hall"], "text": "I'd like Living and Dining side by side, so put the Dining right of the Living. The Hall goes between them, I suppose, but small. And colour Living a light... teal. Is the Hall between the two now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Dining", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Living"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Hall", "position": "between", "anchor": "Living,Dining"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hall", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Living", "color": "teal"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Hall", "position": "between", "anchor": "Living,Dining"}}]}
{"id": "s-0275", "domain": "aviation", "names": ["Tower", "Plane1", "Plane2"], "text": "Tower talks to Plane1 and Plane2 over the radio, so use dashed two-way lines. Plane1 should be to the left of the Tower, Plane2 to the right. Ok, thanks, one more: colour the Tower red.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Tower", "to": "Plane1,Plane2", "style": "dashed", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Plane1", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Tower"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Plane2", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Tower"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Tower", "color": "red"}}]}
{"id": "s-0276", "domain": "nutrition", "names": ["Protein", "Carbs", "Fat"], "text": "Protein is red, Carbs are yellow, Fat is orange. Lock that in. Make a small green circle named Fiber and place it near the Carbs. Is Fiber green?", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Protein", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Carbs", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Fat", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "green", "size": "small", "name": "Fiber", "position": "near", "anchor": "Carbs"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "$new", "color": "green"}}]}
{"id": "s-0277", "domain": "software bugs", "names": ["Report", "Triage", "Fix"], "text": "Report goes to Triage and Triage goes to Fix, i guess you know. Draw em, and make Fix green when done. Also erase the Report i dont need it. What is the degree of Triage then?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Report,Triage,Fix", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Fix", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "Report"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Triage"}}]}
{"id": "s-0278", "domain": "treehouse", "names": ["Ladder", "Deck", "Roof"], "text": "The Roof sits above the Deck, which sits above the Ladder. Move them like so, please. The Ladder is brown and tall... let's say large. Push the Roof toward the back, behind the Deck.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Roof", "position": "above", "anchor": "Deck"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Deck", "position": "above", "anchor": "Ladder"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Ladder", "color": "brown", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Roof"}}]}
{"id": "s-0279", "domain": "hackathon", "names": ["Idea", "Prototype", "Demo"], "text": "Idea becomes Prototype becomes Demo, with the last arrow dashed because we aren't sure. Put the Demo at the bottom right. Also make everything that is not blue turn blue. Is there anything that is not blue left?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Idea,Prototype,Demo", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Prototype", "to": "Demo", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Demo", "position": "bottomRight"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(notcolor=blue,quantifier=all)", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "notColor": "blue"}}]}
{"id": "s-0280", "domain": "geometry", "names": ["Pt1", "Pt2", "Pt3"], "text": "Make a triangle out of the three points. Connect Pt1 to Pt2, Pt2 to Pt3 and Pt3 to Pt1 with plain lines. Arrange them in a circle first, though. And colour all points red.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Pt1,Pt2,Pt3", "layout": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Pt1,Pt2,Pt3,Pt1", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pt1,Pt2,Pt3", "color": "red"}}]}
{"id": "s-0281", "domain": "restaurant", "names": ["Menu", "Chef"], "text": "Dictating here, so bear with me. Put a pink circle called Special above the Menu, uh, then make the Chef bigger. Okay and then connect the Chef to the Special with a dotted line. Finally, tell me which is the nearest shape to the Special.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "pink", "name": "Special", "position": "above", "anchor": "Menu"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Chef"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Chef", "to": "$new", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "$new", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0282", "domain": "blueprint", "names": ["Wall1", "Wall2", "Door"], "text": "Please line the walls up vertically, then add the Door between Wall1 and Wall2. The door must be small and brown. Hmm, and every wall should be gray. Sorry for the pile of requests.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Wall1,Wall2", "axis": "vertical"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Door", "position": "between", "anchor": "Wall1,Wall2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Door", "size": "small", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Wall1,Wall2", "color": "gray"}}]}
{"id": "s-0283", "domain": "genetics lab", "names": ["Gene1", "Gene2"], "text": "Create a navy hexagon called Enzyme between Gene1 and Gene2. Link Gene1 to it and it to Gene2. Hmm, enlarge the thing. Which shapes are hexagons here?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "navy", "name": "Enzyme", "position": "between", "anchor": "Gene1,Gene2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Gene1,$new,Gene2", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "$new"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "shape": "hexagon"}}]}
{"id": "s-0284", "domain": "shipping", "names": ["Port", "Ship", "Crane"], "text": "The Ship docks at the Port and the Crane unloads it. Draw the arrows Ship to Port, Crane to Ship. Make the Crane yellow, then move it up by 60 pixels, it's too low. Is the Crane the topmost shape?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ship", "to": "Port"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Crane", "to": "Ship"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Crane", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Crane", "direction": "up", "distance": "60"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Crane", "position": "top"}}]}
{"id": "s-0285", "domain": "stage lighting", "names": ["Spot1", "Spot2", "Spot3"], "text": "Spread the spotlights evenly, left to right. Make them all yellow, then dim Spot2 by making it tiny. I need Spot3 raised by 30 pixels. Give me a short description of the diagram to check it.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Spot1,Spot2,Spot3", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Spot1,Spot2,Spot3", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Spot2", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Spot3", "direction": "up", "distance": "30"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe"}}]}
{"id": "s-0286", "domain": "language app", "names": ["Lesson", "Quiz", "Badge"], "text": "After the Lesson comes the Quiz, and the Badge is a reward. Link Lesson to Quiz and Quiz to Badge. A badge looks like a star, so reshape it. Make it gold too. Anything else red, then? I mean, are any shapes red?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lesson,Quiz,Badge", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Badge", "shape": "star"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Badge", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "color": "red"}}]}
{"id": "s-0287", "domain": "kitchen", "names": ["Fridge", "Stove"], "text": "Three small orange circles, you know, they're the oranges. Pop them near the Fridge. Then put the Stove in the bottom left, and give the Fridge the label \"cold\".", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "color": "orange", "count": "3", "position": "near", "anchor": "Fridge"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Stove", "position": "bottomLeft"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Fridge", "label": "cold"}}]}
{"id": "s-0288", "domain": "relay race", "names": ["Runner1", "Runner2", "Runner3"], "text": "Chain the three runners in order. The third runner is the anchor, so make him large and gold. Put them in a row. And, wait, how many connections are there?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Runner1,Runner2,Runner3", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Runner3", "size": "large", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Runner1,Runner2,Runner3", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "s-0289", "domain": "cybersecurity", "names": ["Phish", "User", "Vault"], "text": "The Phish tricks the User and then the User opens the Vault. Show it with red arrows. Make the Phish a tiny triangle. Is there a path from Phish to Vault? I guess so.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Phish,User,Vault", "pairing": "chain", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Phish", "shape": "triangle", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Phish", "to": "Vault"}}]}
{"id": "s-0290", "domain": "planets", "names": ["Mercury", "Venus", "Earth"], "text": "Line up Mercury, Venus and Earth in a row, nearest to the Sun first. Colour Mercury gray, Venus orange and Earth blue. Which of them is the biggest? I'd say Earth, tell me if I'm right.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Mercury,Venus,Earth", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mercury", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Venus", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Earth", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0291", "domain": "hotel booking", "names": ["Search", "Room", "Pay"], "text": "Search, Room and Pay go in a chain. Use arrows with the label \"next\" on the second one. Pay is green. Add a huge white circle called Done at the bottom and connect Pay to it.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Search,Room,Pay", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Room", "to": "Pay", "label": "next"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pay", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "white", "size": "huge", "name": "Done", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Pay", "to": "$new"}}]}
{"id": "s-0292", "domain": "beekeeping", "names": ["Hive", "Queen", "Worker"], "text": "The Queen lives in the Hive, so the Hive should be near the Queen. Make the Queen a gold star. Duplicate the Worker 4 times, we have a lot of them. Then tell me how many of the shapes are gold.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Hive", "position": "near", "anchor": "Queen"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Queen", "shape": "star", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Worker", "count": "4"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "color": "gold"}}]}
{"id": "s-0293", "domain": "office move", "names": ["Boxes", "Truck", "Office"], "text": "Boxes are loaded onto the Truck, the Truck drives to the Office. Draw it please. And the Truck is a long rectangle, large and red. Is the Office connected to the Boxes in any direct way?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Boxes,Truck,Office", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Truck", "shape": "rectangle", "size": "large", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Office", "anchor": "Boxes"}}]}
{"id": "s-0294", "domain": "puzzle game", "names": ["Red1", "Blue1", "Exit"], "text": "Make Red1 red, Blue1 blue. Take the Exit and put it at the center. Put a line between Red1 and Blue1, and hmm, since the game allows travel both ways, give it arrowheads on both ends. Is there a path from Red1 to Blue1?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Red1", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Blue1", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Exit", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Red1", "to": "Blue1", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Red1", "to": "Blue1"}}]}
{"id": "s-0295", "domain": "theatre", "names": ["Actor", "Prop", "Stage"], "text": "Move the Actor onto the Stage, that is right above it. The Prop goes left of the Actor. Both of them look a bit pale, so colour the Actor indigo and the Prop orange. Finally, delete every white shape.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Actor", "position": "above", "anchor": "Stage"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Prop", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Actor"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Actor", "color": "indigo"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Prop", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "mention(color=white,quantifier=all)"}}]}
{"id": "s-0296", "domain": "mind map", "names": ["Summer", "Beach", "Hike"], "text": "Summer plan: connect Summer to Beach and to Hike. Beach is a big cyan ellipse, Hike a green triangle. Tell me, which one is further from Summer, Beach or Hike?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Summer", "to": "Beach,Hike"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Beach", "shape": "ellipse", "size": "large", "color": "cyan"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hike", "shape": "triangle", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Summer", "superlative": "farthest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0297", "domain": "tv show", "names": ["Pilot", "Finale"], "text": "Between the Pilot and the Finale add 3 small gray squares, they're the filler episodes. Then connect the Pilot to the Finale with a dotted line, since people skip. Colour the Finale red.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "square", "size": "small", "color": "gray", "count": "3", "position": "between", "anchor": "Pilot,Finale"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Pilot", "to": "Finale", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Finale", "color": "red"}}]}
{"id": "s-0298", "domain": "parking", "names": ["Gate", "Lot", "Meter"], "text": "The Lot sits right of the Gate, and the Meter sits below the Lot. Move them. And what do you reckon, should the Meter be tiny? Yes, shrink it to tiny. Is the Meter below the Gate too?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Lot", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Gate"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Meter", "position": "below", "anchor": "Lot"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Meter", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Meter", "position": "below", "anchor": "Gate"}}]}
{"id": "s-0299", "domain": "drone delivery", "names": ["Base", "Drone", "House"], "text": "Base launches Drone, Drone lands at House. Both arrows please. The Drone is a small white triangle. Remove the connection from Base to Drone though, I changed the plan. Does the Drone still have a neighbor?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Base,Drone,House", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Drone", "shape": "triangle", "size": "small", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Base", "to": "Drone"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Drone"}}]}
{"id": "s-0300", "domain": "art class", "names": ["Palette", "Brush", "Canvas"], "text": "Palette, Brush and Canvas. Put them in a grid, one corner each... well, a grid layout is fine. Brush is brown and small, the Canvas white and huge. Which is the smallest?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Palette,Brush,Canvas", "layout": "grid"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Brush", "color": "brown", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Canvas", "color": "white", "size": "huge"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "smallest"}}]}
